cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "solitary10: a certified computational attack on the solitude of 10"
message: "If you use this repository or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Comitre Rossi"
    given-names: "Caio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/caioross/solitary10"
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic search machinery and structural results bearing on the open
  question of whether 10 is a solitary number, that is, whether the equation
  5*sigma(N) = 9*N has a solution other than N = 10. Includes a certified tree
  search over prime signatures, independent re-derivations of the known
  necessary conditions on a friend of 10, and documented corrections to the
  recent literature.
keywords:
  - number theory
  - solitary numbers
  - abundancy index
  - sum of divisors
  - exact arithmetic
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/caioross/solitary10/blob/main/LICENSE"
